1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,870
(Leonard:)or using the
Schrodinger equation?

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:05,090
(Sheldon:)Howard doesn't.
He's only an engineer.

3
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:09,580
(Leonard:)I was thinking,
we could write a little app

4
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,280
(Leonard:)that would use
handwriting recognition,

5
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,550
(Leonard:)and then run it through a
symbolic evaluation engine.

6
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:14,850
(Leonard:)You just use your smartphone,

7
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:18,020
(Leonard:)take a picture
of the equation and bam!

8
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:22,120
(Raj:)You know what's a great app?
The one that makes fart noises.

9
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,930
(Sheldon:)You know, Leonard,

10
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:29,700
(Sheldon:)that's actually
a valid idea.

11
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,130
(Sheldon:)Very good.

12
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:34,640
(Leonard:)Can you say that and not
make it sound like I'm a cat

13
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:37,370
(Leonard:)who learned
how to use the toilet?

14
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:39,240
(Howard:)No.

15
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,210
(Sheldon:)The two achievements
are equally surprising

16
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:42,680
(Sheldon:)and equally admirable,

17
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,980
(Sheldon:)though if pressed,

18
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:46,410
(Sheldon:)I'd have to give
a slight edge to the cat.

19
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:48,220
(Sheldon:)I'll save you the pain
and nervousness

20
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,580
(Sheldon:)of waiting for the answer.

21
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:53,720
(Sheldon:)I agree to be part of
your project. Congratulations.

22
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,790
(Leonard:)Oh, yay for me.

23
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:58,480
(Leonard:)What about you guys?

24
00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,610
(Leonard:)I can't promise anything,

25
00:00:59,610 --> 00:01:01,900
(Leonard:)but people do make money
off stuff like this.

